# read_channel_mail — Read Channel Mail

(Lead only) Read the FULL channel mail log: every message routed through the channel mailbox (peer messages, real-time replies with in_reply_to chains, and task deliveries), newest first, with read/unread state. Pass agent_id to inspect a specific member's mailbox. Use this BEFORE dispatching a task whose result may already exist — if a worker already computed/delivered the value via mail, do NOT re-dispatch it; reference the concrete result from the mail instead.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** Max mails to return (default 50, max 500) */
  limit?: number;
  /** Optional: only show mails involving this agent (as sender or recipient) */
  agent_id?: string;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://read_channel_mail.

